{
 "file": "story/spt/f02_150_211_00_t011.spt",
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 1032,
   "src": "400a2cd141fe",
   "t": "So that's why {{mio}} "
  },
  {
   "i": 1035,
   "src": "7f541e223536",
   "t": "blew up and quit the {{idol_club}}?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1040,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1046,
   "src": "e65f8d76b8bc",
   "t": "And she held a grudge on top of that."
  },
  {
   "i": 1065,
   "src": "1a59709a7e9a",
   "t": "After quitting the {{idol_club}}, {{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1068,
   "src": "2e458d04aa79",
   "t": "laughed and said she felt refreshed,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1076,
   "src": "50f898800d79",
   "t": "but I know that's a lie."
  },
  {
   "i": 1079,
   "src": "dda2f3f14243",
   "t": "I..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1087,
   "src": "ad55a806cd8d",
   "t": "I like {{mio}} so much, I couldn't stand "
  },
  {
   "i": 1090,
   "src": "414e630566a2",
   "t": "leaving things the way they were."
  },
  {
   "i": 1098,
   "src": "931667faf7d8",
   "t": "If {{aoi}} was right,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1101,
   "src": "012346d6a70e",
   "t": "and {{mio}} changes because I'm gone..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1112,
   "src": "b42fd299f51b",
   "t": "So that's why you went to {{aoi}}'s place?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1129,
   "src": "ede9e401f8a9",
   "t": "Because I had nowhere else to go."
  },
  {
   "i": 1140,
   "src": "c399a4ce34c3",
   "t": "So what are you going to do now?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1143,
   "src": "dc8ea19089c7",
   "t": "Are you really not going back?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1157,
   "src": "cc0584a6ce59",
   "t": "..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1165,
   "src": "492d608d4f71",
   "t": "I can't go back."
  },
  {
   "i": 1173,
   "src": "22a75eb573c4",
   "t": "Even if I went back now, I'm sure\nnothing would change."
  },
  {
   "i": 1184,
   "src": "8cb06cf38b07",
   "t": "Th--"
  },
  {
   "i": 1192,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1201,
   "src": "6a9bc06980f1",
   "t": "That's not true!"
  }
 ]
}
